  "basis": [
    "Revenue: water sold by the litre at KES 1.40, paid by M-Pesa or a prepaid tag at the kiosk, plus tag card sales and service fees. Sales settle the same day, so receipts equal revenue.",
    "Kiosk-level costs (the utility's 22% revenue share on water sales, filtration consumables, attendant commissions, M-Pesa fees and kiosk maintenance) are reported in cost of revenue, so gross profit is the kiosk-level margin after the utility's share. Kiosks (KES 420,000 each) are capitalised and depreciated over five years (KES 7,000 a kiosk a month)."
  ],
