  "contractNotes": [
    "Service contract with the county water utility: Maji Loop operates kiosks on utility mains connections and pays the utility 22% of water sales each month as its revenue share, which covers the bulk water. Five-year term from 1 Mar 2023, renewable from 28 Feb 2028.",
    "The kiosk meters are reconciled with the utility's meter reads each month. For 2025, metered sales were 41,000,000 litres and the utility's reads differed by less than 0.5%.",
